      "title": "epan: Return unsigned from tvb_raw_offset",
      "message": "epan: Return unsigned from tvb_raw_offset\n\nThis requires sorting tvb->raw_offset as unsigned. Instead of using\n-1 to mean \"hasn't been calculated yet\", add a flag for if it has\nbeen calculated.\n\nWhen creating a subset tvb, if the raw offset has been calculated\nfor the parent, go ahead and calculate it for the subset. (We'll\nprobably need it later, and this saves some recursion later.)\nWe probably actually can calculate the raw offset for all the types\nof tvbuffs we have upon creation (a composite is 0), which might\nmake sense.\n\nAdd some notes to the documentation about the small differences\nbetween tvb_offset_from_real_beginning and tvb_raw_offset.\n",
      "author_name": "John Thacker",
      "author_email": "johnthacker@gmail.com",
      "authored_date": "2025-12-30T16:11:29.000-05:00",
      "committer_name": "John Thacker",
